---
import Icon from "blume/components/Icon.astro";
---

<section class="overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-border bg-muted/45 px-6 py-16 text-center sm:px-12 sm:py-20">
  <span class="mx-auto inline-flex size-12 items-center justify-center rounded-blume bg-background text-accent shadow-sm">
    <Icon name="pen-line" size={22} />
  </span>
  <h2 class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-balance font-medium text-3xl tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">
    Start with one paragraph. Grow into a workspace.
  </h2>
  <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-lg text-balance text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
    Drop the component into a SvelteKit page, then add plugins, your own
    blocks, and a collaboration room when you need them.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
    <a
      class="inline-flex h-10 items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-foreground px-5 font-medium text-background text-sm transition-opacity hover:opacity-85"
      href="/docs/getting-started/quick-start"
    >
      Read the quick start
      <Icon name="arrow-right" size={15} />
    </a>
    <a
      class="inline-flex h-10 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-border bg-background px-5 font-medium text-sm transition-colors hover:bg-muted"
      href="/docs/server/quick-start"
    >
      Deploy the server
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
